     top2_comparator      : 1066 cells

Synthesis Status: 0 Errors, 0 Critical Warnings

======================================================================
EXPECTED SIMULATION OUTPUT
======================================================================

The simulation displays:
   - Loaded input objects
   - Hardware latency
   - Valid mask
   - Primary object selected
   - Alternative object selected
   - PASS/FAIL status per test case

Expected final result:
   TOTAL: 5 PASS, 0 FAIL
   ALL TESTS PASSED

======================================================================
NOTES
======================================================================

- memory_model.v is for simulation only and is not synthesized.
- The RTL design has been functionally verified using QuestaSim.
- The design follows a modular AXI4-based architecture suitable
  for FPGA-based integration with the VEGA processor in Stage 3A.
- 5 DSP48E1 blocks are inferred automatically by Vivado for the
  Score1 multiply operations in top2_comparator.v.

